# The pusher's own record of its last push (issue #284). LOCAL by design: a receipt that
# rode the pushed history would move the remote tip PAST the sha it records, which is the
# one property the publish-freshness leg compares against. Written by `tools/publish.py`,
# read by the patrol, never committed.
evidence/publish-receipt.json
evidence/publish-receipt.json.tmp
